# Angular CLI Commands

**Complete reference for Angular CLI commands and usage patterns**

## Project Setup

### Create New Project
```bash
# Create new Angular workspace
ng new my-app

# Create with specific options
ng new my-app --routing --style=scss --standalone
```

### Generate Components
```bash
# Generate standalone component
ng generate component user --standalone

# Generate component with inline template
ng generate component user --inline-template

# Generate component in specific path
ng generate component features/user/user-list
```

### Generate Services
```bash
# Generate service
ng generate service user

# Generate service with providedIn root
ng generate service user --skip-tests
```

### Generate Modules
```bash
# Generate feature module
ng generate module user

# Generate module with routing
ng generate module user --routing
```

## Development

### Serve Application
```bash
# Start development server
ng serve

# Start on specific port
ng serve --port 4201

# Open browser automatically
ng serve --open

# Use specific configuration
ng serve --configuration=development
```

### Build Application
```bash
# Development build
ng build

# Production build
ng build --configuration production

# Build with source maps
ng build --source-map

# Build for specific output path
ng build --output-path=dist/my-app
```

## Testing

### Run Tests
```bash
# Run unit tests
ng test

# Run tests in watch mode
ng test --watch

# Run tests with code coverage
ng test --code-coverage

# Run specific test file
ng test --include='**/user.service.spec.ts'
```

### E2E Testing
```bash
# Run E2E tests
ng e2e

# Run with specific configuration
ng e2e --configuration=production
```

## Code Generation

### Generate Guards
```bash
ng generate guard auth
ng generate guard auth --functional
```

### Generate Interceptors
```bash
ng generate interceptor http
```

### Generate Pipes
```bash
ng generate pipe currency
```

### Generate Directives
```bash
ng generate directive highlight
```

### Generate Resolvers
```bash
ng generate resolver user
```

## Linting and Formatting

### Lint Code
```bash
# Run linter
ng lint

# Fix linting errors automatically
ng lint --fix

# Lint specific project
ng lint my-project
```

### Format Code
```bash
# Format all files
npx prettier --write "**/*.{ts,html,scss}"

# Check formatting
npx prettier --check "**/*.{ts,html,scss}"
```

## Configuration

### Update Angular
```bash
# Update Angular CLI globally
npm install -g @angular/cli@latest

# Update Angular in project
ng update @angular/core @angular/cli

# Update with migration
ng update @angular/core --migrate-only
```

### Add Dependencies
```bash
# Add Angular Material
ng add @angular/material

# Add PWA support
ng add @angular/pwa

# Add Angular Universal (SSR)
ng add @nguniversal/express-engine
```

## Build Optimization

### Analyze Bundle
```bash
# Analyze bundle size
ng build --stats-json
npx webpack-bundle-analyzer dist/stats.json
```

### Production Build
```bash
# Optimized production build
ng build --configuration production --aot --optimization
```

## Common Workflows

### Complete Feature Generation
```bash
# Generate complete feature module
ng generate module features/user --routing
ng generate component features/user/user-list --module=features/user
ng generate service features/user/user
```

### Standalone Component Setup
```bash
# Generate standalone component with routing
ng generate component user --standalone --routing
```

